&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1j4zddb&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who we are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab ® is a global leader in IoT and connected transportation and certified “Great Place to Work™.” We are a company of diverse and talented individuals who work together to help businesses grow and succeed, and increase the safety and sustainability of our communities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab is advancing security, connecting commercial vehicles to the internet and providing web-based analytics to help customers better manage their fleets. Geotab’s open platform and Geotab Marketplace ®, offering hundreds of third-party solution options, allows both small and large businesses to automate operations by integrating vehicle data with their other data assets. Processing billions of data points a day, Geotab leverages data analytics and machine learning to improve productivity, optimize fleets through the reduction of fuel consumption, enhance driver safety and achieve strong compliance to regulatory changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Our team is growing and we’re looking for people who follow their passion, think differently and want to make an impact. Ours is a fast paced, ever changing environment. Geotabbers accept that challenge and are willing to take on new tasks and activities - ones that may not always be described in the initial job description. Join us for a fulfilling career with opportunities to innovate, great benefits, and our fun and inclusive work culture. Reach your full potential with Geotab. To see what it’s like to be a Geotabber, check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.geotab.com/blog/&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and follow us @InsideGeotab on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidegeotab/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who you are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0&quot;&gt;We are always looking for amazing talent who can contribute to our growth and deliver results! Geotab is seeking a Product Manager who will direct product development from conception to launch and is responsible for discovering, developing and carefully cultivating new products and on-going product enhancements that support Geotab’s business models and continued growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,2&quot;&gt;. If you love technology, and are keen to join an industry leader — we would love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,0&quot;&gt;As a Product Manager your key area of responsibility will be building Geotab’s customer intelligence by identifying which ideas and opportunities should be promoted into features to support pushing the product strategy forward&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,2&quot;&gt;. You will need to work closely with cross functional teams (Design, Engineering, Marketing, Support and others) as well as senior members of the team and product leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,3&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,4&quot;&gt;. To be successful in this role you will be a self starter, resourceful with strong analytical skills, acute perception, and the ability to problem-solve to well-judged decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,5&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,6&quot;&gt;. In addition, the successful candidate will have a strategic mindset, an entrepreneurial spirit, and a strong understanding of user engagement metrics and product KPIs to drive data-informed decision-making.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,7&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;How you&#39;ll make an impact:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-42&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,0&quot;&gt;The primary role is to truly understand the customer and its associated market&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-43&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Perform customer discovery interviews with prospective and existing customers and partners to identify product gaps and generate news ideas for continuous value add for existing &lt;span class=&quot;citation-857 citation-end-857&quot;&gt;customers, grow market share for new customers and to overall improve Geotab’s customer experience&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-856 citation-end-856&quot;&gt;.&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-44&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-855 citation-end-855&quot;&gt;Leverage various research methodologies and customer inputs to identify common patterns, pain points, problems to be solved/jobs to be done and use&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; this to identify relevant solution opportunities/product efforts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-45&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Develop a product roadmap and align internal stakeholders to the developed roadmap strategy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-46&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0,0&quot;&gt;Work closely with senior members of the team and product leadership to provide input on the long term vision of the product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-47&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,0&quot;&gt;Work with cross functional teams (Design, Engineering, Marketing, Support and others) to build and exec&lt;span class=&quot;citation-854 citation-end-854&quot;&gt;ute the product development and go to market strategy for key roadmap deliverables&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-853 citation-end-853&quot;&gt;.&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-48&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-852 citation-end-852&quot;&gt;Prioritize building what matters most by balancing short term sales targets with long term strategic investments for the business&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-851 citation-end-851&quot;&gt;.&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-49&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0,0&quot;&gt;Col&lt;span class=&quot;citation-850&quot;&gt;laboratively define and drive reporting and monitoring mechanisms against set product outcomes and use them as a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-849 citation-850 citation-end-850&quot;&gt;tool to measure continued success of product efforts (both qualitative and quantitative)&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-849 citation-end-849&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-847 citation-848 citation-end-848&quot;&gt;.&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-847 citation-end-847&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-50&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-845 citation-846 citation-end-846&quot;&gt;Col&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-845 citation-end-845&quot;&gt;laborate with other product managers on designing and executing market feedback loops and incorporate into produc&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;t planning: Sales (participate in win-loss interviews and analysis; identify hard sales blockers and so&lt;span class=&quot;citation-844 citation-end-844&quot;&gt;ft sales objections) and Retention and Referral (feedback/satisfaction/effectiveness interviews and analysis)&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;14&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-843 citation-end-843&quot;&gt;.&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;15&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-51&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,9,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-842 citation-end-842&quot;&gt;Clearly communicate the Why for every product effort and educate other stakeholders on the problems to be solved, busines&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;s objectives, etc. Leverage this in collaboration with UX designers, developers, data scientists and other stakeholders to do problem and solution validation, translate customer needs into user stories/feature epics/work to be done, and prioritize epics relative to technical debt and other company product investments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,9,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,9,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-52&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,10,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,10,0,0&quot;&gt;Help improve the Product Management practice at Geotab&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,10,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,10,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-53&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,11,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,11,0,0&quot;&gt;Self starter, resourceful with strong analytical skills with the ability to problem-solve to well-judged decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,11,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,11,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-54&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,0&quot;&gt;3 - 5 years of required previous experience in product management and/or customer discovery or a related field (experience in a SaaS environment is highly valued)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-55&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Bachelors in a related field or Post-secondary Diploma/Degree (Engineering, Business, Computer Science highly valued), or equivalent combination of education and work experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-56&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Excellent written, verbal, and listening skills with strong empathy and presentation ability (in person and virtually)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-57&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience with user engagement metrics, product KPIs, data-informed decision-making, and Agile planning methods/practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-58&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0,0&quot;&gt;Strategic mindset with solid negotiation, conflict resolution, relationship management skills, and ability to adapt to growing technology and market demands&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-59&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0,0&quot;&gt;Self-starter, resourceful, and strong analytical skills with an ability to stitch together disparate insights to uncover common patterns&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_9af5abfbfed33c5f-60&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0,0&quot;&gt;Strong organizational skills to manage products through discovery to launch, alongside an entrepreneurial mindset comfortable in a flat organization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
